sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Operator
    participant App as Desktop App (LiveMonitorTab)
    participant ST as EventHistoryStore (SQLite)
    participant W as StreamWorker
    participant B as Backend (WebSocket :5020)
    participant RD as RiskDetector
    U ->> App: Enter user and source, press Start Session
    App ->> ST: open_session(user_id)
    ST -->> App: session_id
    App ->> W: start(uri, source, jpeg_quality)
    W ->> W: Open OpenCV capture
    alt Source cannot be opened
        W -->> App: status error: Failed to open video source
    else Source opened
        W ->> B: Connect
        B ->> RD: Build detector (checks model files exist)
        loop Each captured frame
            W ->> B: JPEG bytes
            alt Not a decodable JPEG or PNG
                B -->> W: error: Expected a JPEG or PNG frame
                W -->> App: Show error badge, session continues
            else Valid frame
                B ->> RD: detect, track, DetNG rules, ST-GNN score, Kalman fuse
                RD -->> B: rule, model, fused scores, covariance, reason
                B -->> W: Pickled result dictionary
                W -->> App: frame, scores, round-trip time
                App ->> ST: record_estimate(session, fused, covariance)
                App -->> U: Overlays with IDs and PPE, risk gauge, status badge
            end
        end
    end
    U ->> App: Open Retroactive tab
    App ->> ST: Read-only query by user, date, threshold
    ST -->> App: Sessions, estimates, daily buckets
    App -->> U: KPIs, timeline with covariance band, histogram, CSV export
